# Theme (Sage 11)

Stack: Blade + Acorn + Tailwind v4 + Vite 8. Design CSS is `resources/css/keystone.css`, not ad-hoc Tailwind utility soup.

## Custom post types

Constants: `Catalog::LISTING` (`listing`), `Catalog::BOOKING` (`booking`), `Catalog::AGENT` (`agent`). **Acreline Core** (`plugins/acreline-core`) is the store-correct registrar. Theme `app/post-types.php` is the concept fallback when the plugin is not loaded. Store zips set `KS_DISABLE_THEME_CPTS`. See `marketplace.mdc`.

- Rewrites: `/listing/{slug}/`, `/agent/{slug}/`. Bookings are not public. CPT `query_var` is false so `?listing=` is not a WP query var.
- Booking preselect: `?listing_id={post_id}` (composer also reads legacy `?listing=`). Never use `?listing=` as a public query — it 404s `/book/` when the CPT query var is registered.
- All custom fields go through `Catalog::getMeta` / `updateMeta` → keys are `ks_{field}`.
- Featured flag: store `1` or omit. Do **not** store `"0"` and treat it as false — `(bool) '0'` is true in PHP. `featuredListings()` uses `! empty($item['featured'])`.
- Listing agent is `ks_listing_agent` (agent post ID), not a slug.
- Showings POST to `keystone/v1/bookings` and create Booking posts (`requested` → `confirmed` → `completed`).

## Page copy → Gutenberg blocks

Marketing page content is in **Gutenberg block attributes** (not `ks_*` post meta). Blocks are registered in `app/blocks.php` and `resources/js/blocks/index.js`.

- `PageCopy.php` is retained for migration reference and SEO fallbacks only.
- Blade page templates (`front-page.blade.php`, `page-listings.blade.php`, etc.) call `@php(the_content())`. All section HTML comes from block render callbacks in `app/blocks.php`.
- Block attributes store copy text. Site-wide defaults (phone, address, hours, social) stay in **Appearance → Customize → Identity**.
- Page template mapping still applies — the Blade file determines which template WordPress sees.

| Slug | Template |
| --- | --- |
| home | `front-page.blade.php` |
| listings | `page-listings.blade.php` |
| book | `page-book.blade.php` |
| areas | `page-areas.blade.php` |
| guide | `page-guide.blade.php` |
| agents | `page-agents.blade.php` |
| contact | `page-contact.blade.php` |
| blog | `home.blade.php` |

## Query / templates

Do **not** set `is_page` / `is_singular` without a real `WP_Post`. Sage / `post-template.php` will 500 (`ID` on null). If you swap a template for a virtual route, keep the query non-singular and use `template_include`.

After Blade edits, if the page looks stale: `wp acorn view:clear --path="$HOME/wp" --allow-root`.

## Admin

Pages / posts: **Gutenberg blocks**. CPTs (listing, booking, agent): classic metaboxes in `app/admin.php`.

Image fields use the media library (`resources/js/admin-media.js`): listing/agent `image`, post featured image. Store a URL in `ks_*` (Unsplash hotlinks still work). Uploads also set the featured image.
